law.text:
		The Department shall administer this chapter and shall have the following powers and duties:

To establish the criteria for determining what areas qualify as enterprise zones. Such criteria shall include, but not be limited to, the distress criteria specified in § 59.1-545;


To monitor the implementation and operation of this chapter;


To evaluate and report on the Enterprise Zone Program;


To administer, enforce, and interpret the regulations promulgated by the Board; and


To allocate grant funds in accordance with the provisions of this chapter.
